{"version":1,"content":"<p>教宗良十四世周二（13日）接受肺結節切除手術，並確診患上肺腺癌後【相關報道】，醫生周三（14日）表示教宗已下牀行走，進食了早、午餐，進行了呼吸物理治療，驗血與胸腔X光檢查結果「正常」，康復進度「符合預期」，正等待化驗結果，判斷癌細胞有否擴散。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:36.193555+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T02:59:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T08:57:50.814198+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416436+00:00","content_hash":"21b5d77b72b75354d89f41879547411fec9d6c721450833a4b2647b70eee0321","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}